WEBVTT

00:06:58.581 --> 00:07:01.072
because six minutes later,
with a new partner,

00:07:01.096 --> 00:07:02.866
I was falling behind again.

00:07:03.914 --> 00:07:07.694
On the other hand,
I never felt disconsolate.

00:07:08.476 --> 00:07:12.661
And when I flew away from Japan
and started playing singles again

00:07:12.685 --> 00:07:15.787
with my English archrival,

00:07:15.811 --> 00:07:20.866
I noticed that after every defeat,
I was really brokenhearted.

00:07:21.953 --> 00:07:25.224
But after every victory,
I couldn't sleep either,

00:07:25.248 --> 00:07:27.671
because I knew there was
only one way to go,

00:07:27.695 --> 00:07:29.486
and that was down.